#
# Well-formed: a math:FlagshipScenario binding all four realizing/enforcing artifacts —
# a worked example, a competency question, a counter-example, and an enforcing failure
# class that IS a math:MathConformanceFailure subclass (math:WrongE8WeylOrder, resolved
# against module.ttl). Conforms to math:FlagshipScenarioShape (all four cardinalities
# and the sh:sparql subclass check) and validates with no findings.
# Bound by ex:ecFlagshipCanonical.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:wiredScenario a math:FlagshipScenario ;
    math:demonstratedByExample "examples/e8-symmetry.ttl" ;
    math:demonstratedByCompetency <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/math/tests/cqE8RootSystem> ;
    math:guardedByCounterExample "tests/counter-examples/e8-wrong-weyl-order.ttl" ;
    math:enforcesFailureClass math:WrongE8WeylOrder .
